TASK (improve-wide-retune-alias-v3): Improve the worst-case (all 1024 tolerance corners) stopband rejection at 19 kHz-1 MHz of the adopted FE-AAF-001 reference by retuning the passive parts of the stage-1 and stage-2 filters, without consuming more passband flatness or gain margin than the explicit hard constraints allow. Contract requirements, checks and thresholds are not changed.
Frozen objective, constraints and baseline:
